Package: clipbridge
Version: 0.3.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: xclip
Maintainer: Yousef Mohiey <yousefmohiey@users.noreply.github.com>
Description: Shared clipboard over your local network
 Copy text or an image on one device and paste it on another.
 Everything stays on your LAN. No account, no cloud.
 One device is the host, the rest connect to it automatically.
